# Test: show event list is wired (verb-first, replaces noun-first `event list`)
# VALIDATES: the meta plugin merges `show event list` onto the show verb tree,
#   so the event-list command is discoverable and dispatches to its handler
#   (ze-bgp:event-list).
# PREVENTS: event-list becoming unreachable after moving from `event list` to
#   `show event list` under the existing `show event` container.
cmd=foreground:seq=1:exec=ze help command
expect=exit:code=0
expect=stdout:contains=show event list
